    "Playlists on your devices mix music from open catalogs and your own files. They stay on your devices." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Playlists auf deinen Geräten mischen Musik aus offenen Katalogen und eigene Dateien. Sie bleiben auf deinen Geräten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Las listas de tus dispositivos mezclan música de catálogos abiertos y tus propios archivos. Se quedan en tus dispositivos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les playlists sur vos appareils mêlent la musique des catalogues ouverts et vos propres fichiers. Elles restent sur vos appareils."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Le playlist sui tuoi dispositivi mescolano musica dai cataloghi aperti e i tuoi file. Restano sui tuoi dispositivi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Playlists on your devices mix music from your server, from open catalogs and your own files. They stay on your devices." : {
